DonKbot micromouse chassis plates: the TT, N20 and NEMA 8 stepper motor plates, the camera and
sensor support library the N20 plate needs, and the four dkb_* libraries every plate includes.
The core_*.scad files are not vendored here - they live in the pinned lib_robo_core tree, and
OpenSCAD finds them through OPENSCADPATH. The upstream LICENSE is copied verbatim from the
pinned commit. The PCB fabrication output, photos and maze walls are excluded.

